# Redstone 9X — IceWM Start menu (Windows 95 canonical layout)
#
# IceWM's own built-in Settings / Logout / Windows / Run / About / Help items
# are disabled in ~/.icewm/preferences (Show*=0), so THIS file defines the
# ENTIRE menu.  The top level is the canonical Windows 95 order with the
# SerenityOS-style default-app quartet on top (Mètsàtron 2026-07-19: they
# live in both the menu AND the quick launch — we have the vertical room):
#   Terminal / File Manager / Web Browser / Text Editor /
#   Programs / Documents / Desktop / Settings / Find / Help / Run... / Shut Down...

prog "Terminal"      utilities-terminal       /home/metsatron/.local/bin/redstone-9x-bash --window
prog "File Manager"  system-file-manager      pcmanfm
prog "Web Browser"   web-browser              firefox
prog "Text Editor"   accessories-text-editor  mousepad

separator

